{
    "title": "Barber Hair Salon Shop",
    "description": "\ud83d\udc88Customers will arrive at the hair salon wants to get a fresh haircut or shave\ud83e\ude92 for a modern look! Your job is to provide a possible haircut, shaves, colours, and styles for your clients so they leave the hair salon happy! in case the customer becomes angry and leave the barber shop, you will not be paid, once you make a mess of their hair! Barber game 2024\ud83e\uddd4\ud83e\uddd1\r\n\r\nAll of the cutting instruments you'll need to become proficient will be available at your hair salon (barber shop\ud83d\udc88)\r\nYou will be able to shave, change the colour of your hair, and design haircut tattoos with their assistance!\r\n\r\nTattoo Barber Salon Game Features:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc87\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Special mechanics in Barber Game\r\n\ud83d\udc87\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f A variety of cutting tools in barber sim\r\n\ud83d\udc87\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0fStunning 3D visuals of hair salon games\ud83d\udc88\r\n\ud83d\udc87\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Crazy hairstyle concepts in the hair cutting game\ud83e\uddd4\ud83e\uddd1\r\n\r\nExperience the art of hair cutting\u2702\ufe0f and shaving\ud83e\ude92 with Hair Tattoo: Barber Shop Games, a hair coloring and barber simulator. Make a world-class upgrade for your barbershop! Begin your career in the hair salon right now and amaze your clientele with \r\nmodern haircuts! So, what are you waiting for? Barber Hair Salon Shop and share your reviews in the comment box!!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udc88Customers will arrive at the hair salon wants to get a fresh haircut or shave\ud83e\ude92 for a modern look! Your job is to provide a possible haircut, shaves, colours, and styles for your clients so they leave the hair salon happy! in case the customer becomes angry and leave the barber shop, you will not be paid, once you make a mess of their hair! Barber game 2024\ud83e\uddd4\ud83e\uddd1<br><br>All of the cutting instruments you&#39;ll need to become proficient will be available at your hair salon (barber shop\ud83d\udc88)<br>You will be able to shave, change the colour of your hair, and design haircut tattoos with their assistance!<br><br>Tattoo Barber Salon Game Features:<br><br>\ud83d\udc87\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Special mechanics in Barber Game<br>\ud83d\udc87\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f A variety of cutting tools in barber sim<br>\ud83d\udc87\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0fStunning 3D visuals of hair salon games\ud83d\udc88<br>\ud83d\udc87\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Crazy hairstyle concepts in the hair cutting game\ud83e\uddd4\ud83e\uddd1<br><br>Experience the art of hair cutting\u2702\ufe0f and shaving\ud83e\ude92 with Hair Tattoo: Barber Shop Games, a hair coloring and barber simulator. Make a world-class upgrade for your barbershop! Begin your career in the hair salon right now and amaze your clientele with <br>modern haircuts! So, what are you waiting for? Barber Hair Salon Shop and share your reviews in the comment box!!",
    "summary": "Play this hair salon game let's start the hair challenge and create a hairstyle.",
